    {
      "id": "claim_af480d52440d4df08aceef49534b601b",
      "statement": "The runtime path of a single agent request is: MCP tool wrapper (mcp-server.ts) calls a tool module, which normalizes input (including tabId) and calls page-actions.ts/page-context.ts; those build WebSocket request options consumed by websocket-client.ts, which authenticates, attaches a target envelope, sends, and parses the response; the WebSocket relay (servers/websocket/src/server.ts) routes MCP requests to the selected extension by pending request id and forwards extension responses back unchanged; the extension background delegates to BrijioBackgroundController which dispatches by payload type to adapter interfaces; the shared page-reader.ts helpers resolve a tab, inject content.js, and message the content script; results flow back the same path.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/shared/src/background-controller.ts",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:59770e90cdb08753ea087d409ec6067e35aeeee9c34f20b4a1e18b4a09afa167"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/shared/src/page-reader.ts",
