    {
      "id": "claim_1f3b7811895548dabc39ddafe8592610",
      "statement": "Per ADR 0061, parseRouterErrorEnvelope in servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts forwards router-level errors as-is: it validates the envelope is an error type with a string message, then forwards any string code (including codes not in the MCP server's local BrijioErrorCode union such as invalid_message and invalid_json) and only returns invalidResponse when the envelope structure itself is malformed. parseErrorPayload preserves stale_context and page_navigated with their structured detail, and forwards every other original string code from the extension (e.g. not_supported, cors_blocked, http_error, size_exceeded) instead of wrapping as browser_error, falling back to browser_error only for a non-string code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/architecture/decisions/0061-forward-error-codes-through-mcp.md",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:310109f18d01749c94d321d02f8149b45ec6e17ce9a956501579fdce0f28d6be"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts#L1498-L1524",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ed70a09aa0b7503b823d47981f16ae1b38df3cb24ef2e06cebc7dbaf327405c2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts#L1608-L1658",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0f580bf2b70d0a763e4b2068ad90dbfeb9d5cf88fb26a200a1389e0815cff9fa:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_44602733423d465a8371660ea6c4496e",
      "statement": "The MCP result error code field is typed as an open string, not a closed union: BrijioResourceResult<T> and BrijioToolResult<T> (with BrijioToolErrorCode = string) use code: string so they can carry arbitrary forwarded error codes, removing the need for the MCP server to keep a parallel BrijioErrorCode union in sync with the shared package.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://servers/mcp/src/page-reading-tool.ts#L16-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9223b95efb1aa6558bfacd2cb1086a9b5988f664e8bcdf5633901726efd8adc2:"
