      "id": "claim_eb9494de866a4822af3d0df2af6b7ad3",
      "statement": "Tool results, including errors, are returned to the agent inside the MCP content text field as JSON rather than as MCP-level isError flags; capture_screenshot is the exception, setting isError true on a failed capture so vision-capable clients can distinguish a missing image from a successful one.",
