      "id": "claim_b4048e4ad708484f8860bfeb251a94c8",
      "statement": "A change to MCP tool inputs generally requires coordinated updates in three places: servers/mcp/src/protocol.ts (envelope builders/parsers and the WebSocketEnvelope.target shape), the shared background controller (extractTabId, dispatch branches, and the adapter interfaces PageReaderAdapter/PageActionAdapter/PageBatchAdapter/PageNavigationAdapter that accept tabId), and both extension adapters (clients/extensions/chrome/src/background.ts and clients/extensions/safari/src/background.ts) whose adapter implementations and tabs/scripting wrappers must forward the parameter to the shared page-reader.ts helpers and navigation adapters.",
